    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/42aecddfbce7a96c6d0b836f98d3c5be.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/42aecddfbce7a96c6d0b836f98d3c5be.webm?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/42aecddfbce7a96c6d0b836f98d3c5be.mp4?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Kawai Girls Panic \u2014 arcade madness in the best traditions of slot machines!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/1a7174bece45ace145df3967dc768fe2.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/1a7174bece45ace145df3967dc768fe2.webm?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/1a7174bece45ace145df3967dc768fe2.mp4?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a fearless alien with an important mission: to free six sexy girls kidnapped by evil monsters! Gradually &quot;capture&quot; the screen, avoiding dexterous enemies and deadly traps to open a hidden image of a cute girl. With each level, you will find more and more daring and piquant images of heroines and new dangerous enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the most dexterous will be able to defeat all the bosses and collect a full gallery of beauties!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/dff62704630d63b789df60a1abd48ec5.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/dff62704630d63b789df60a1abd48ec5.webm?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/dff62704630d63b789df60a1abd48ec5.mp4?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/fe55e2070222e6d49de5421e90cb36c7.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=128 height=128 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/fe55e2070222e6d49de5421e90cb36c7.webm?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2728 Game Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exciting gameplay with arcade mechanics of capturing fields</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc976 unique heroines, each with their own character and style</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 40 highly detailed images - the further, the hotter</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deadly enemies and dynamic battles with bosses</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Special bonuses and improvements that make the path to victory easier</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Time limit - think fast, act even faster!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish pixel graphics inspired by classic arcade games</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Energetic chiptune music that does not let you relax</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gallery for those who like to &quot;collect&quot; ... everything \ud83d\udc40</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/d2a7786b48425a818c9b5b354943e0b4.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/d2a7786b48425a818c9b5b354943e0b4.webp?t=1753437721\" class=\"bb_img\" width=128 height=128 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/c327b4bfbba9c700ac7da285e7bbacd1.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/c327b4bfbba9c700ac7da285e7bbacd1.webm?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/c327b4bfbba9c700ac7da285e7bbacd1.mp4?t=1753437721\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udca5 Break through the arcade fever and open all the Kawai Girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready for a real panic - Kawai Girls Panic is already waiting for its hero!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3833460/extras/ebda4ca593d47db7ec4bb2e245a62302.poster.avif?t=1753437721\" width=614 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_ite